## Interface: 16001
## Title: CraftRoute
## Notes: The cheapest way to level each profession from where you are: which recipe to craft at each skill level, how many, and a shopping list. Uses AtlasLoot's skill colors, DepositWise's AH prices, vendor prices, and what's in your bags and bank. Learns your real skill-up odds.
